  "description": "HOMHAW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C57 H107 Ce3 Co2 N3 O24,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.227-3.877 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.69-132.79°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ce3Co2O2(piv)7(bda)2(bicine)]·MeCN.",
